      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Weaseling Words",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "K'zaard weaves together a short speech that gives the listener pause. Enemies within 30 feet must attempt a DC 24 Will save save. While a creature is frightened by this ability, it's Off-Guard to K'zaard.\n\n---\nCritical Success No effect, and the creature is temporarily immune to Weaseling Words for 1 minute.\n\nSuccess The creature is unaffected.\n\nFailure The creature is uncertain and Frightened 1.\n\nCritical Failure The creature is riddled with self-doubt about its own actions. It is Frightened 2 and can't take hostile actions against K'zaard until the frightened condition ends."
